[
  {
    "content_id": "10032001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;耶和華的話臨到亞米太的兒子約拿，說：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;「你起來往尼尼微大城去，向其中的居民呼喊，因為他們的惡達到我面前。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;約拿卻起來，逃往他施去躲避耶和華；下到約帕，遇見一隻船，要往他施去。他就給了船價，上了船，要與船上的人同往他施去躲避耶和華。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;然而耶和華使海中起大風，海就狂風大作，甚至船幾乎破壞。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;水手便懼怕，各人哀求自己的神。他們將船上的貨物拋在海中，為要使船輕些。約拿已下到底艙，躺臥沉睡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;船主到他那裏對他說：「你這沉睡的人哪，為何這樣呢？起來，求告你的神，或者神顧念我們，使我們不致滅亡。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;船上的人彼此說：「來吧，我們掣籤，看看這災臨到我們是因誰的緣故。」於是他們掣籤，掣出約拿來。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;眾人對他說：「請你告訴我們，這災臨到我們是因誰的緣故？你以何事為業？你從哪裏來？你是哪一國？屬哪一族的人？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;他說：「我是希伯來人。我敬畏耶和華－那創造滄海旱地之天上的上帝。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;他們就大大懼怕，對他說：「你做的是甚麼事呢？」他們已經知道他躲避耶和華，因為他告訴了他們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;他們問他說：「我們當向你怎樣行，使海浪平靜呢？」這話是因海浪越發翻騰。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;他對他們說：「你們將我抬起來，拋在海中，海就平靜了；我知道你們遭這大風是因我的緣故。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;然而那些人竭力盪槳，要把船攏岸，卻是不能，因為海浪越發向他們翻騰。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;他們便求告耶和華說：「耶和華啊，我們懇求你，不要因這人的性命使我們死亡，不要使流無辜血的罪歸與我們；因為你－耶和華是隨自己的意旨行事。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;他們遂將約拿抬起，拋在海中，海的狂浪就平息了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;那些人便大大敬畏耶和華，向耶和華獻祭，並且許願。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;耶和華安排一條大魚吞了約拿，他在魚腹中三日三夜。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;約拿在魚腹中禱告耶和華－他的上帝，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;說： 我遭遇患難求告耶和華， 你就應允我； 從陰間的深處呼求， 你就俯聽我的聲音。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你將我投下深淵， 就是海的深處； 大水環繞我， 你的波浪洪濤都漫過我身。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我說：我從你眼前雖被驅逐， 我仍要仰望你的聖殿。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;諸水環繞我，幾乎淹沒我； 深淵圍住我； 海草纏繞我的頭。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我下到山根， 地的門將我永遠關住。 耶和華－我的上帝啊， 你卻將我的性命從坑中救出來。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;我心在我裏面發昏的時候， 我就想念耶和華。 我的禱告進入你的聖殿， 達到你的面前。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;那信奉虛無之神的人， 離棄憐愛他們的主；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;但我必用感謝的聲音獻祭與你。 我所許的願，我必償還。 救恩出於耶和華。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;耶和華吩咐魚，魚就把約拿吐在旱地上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;耶和華的話二次臨到約拿說：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;「你起來！往尼尼微大城去，向其中的居民宣告我所吩咐你的話。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;約拿便照耶和華的話起來，往尼尼微去。這尼尼微是極大的城，有三日的路程。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;約拿進城走了一日，宣告說：「再等四十日，尼尼微必傾覆了！」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;尼尼微人信服上帝，便宣告禁食，從最大的到至小的都穿麻衣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;這信息傳到尼尼微王的耳中，他就下了寶座，脫下朝服，披上麻布，坐在灰中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;他又使人遍告尼尼微通城，說：「王和大臣有令，人不可嘗甚麼，牲畜、牛羊不可吃草，也不可喝水。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;人與牲畜都當披上麻布；人要切切求告上帝。各人回頭離開所行的惡道，丟棄手中的強暴。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;或者上帝轉意後悔，不發烈怒，使我們不致滅亡，也未可知。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;於是上帝察看他們的行為，見他們離開惡道，他就後悔，不把所說的災禍降與他們了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;這事約拿大大不悅，且甚發怒，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;就禱告耶和華說：「耶和華啊，我在本國的時候豈不是這樣說嗎？我知道你是有恩典、有憐憫的上帝，不輕易發怒，有豐盛的慈愛，並且後悔不降所說的災，所以我急速逃往他施去。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;耶和華啊，現在求你取我的命吧！因為我死了比活着還好。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;耶和華說：「你這樣發怒合乎理嗎？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;於是約拿出城，坐在城的東邊，在那裏為自己搭了一座棚，坐在棚的蔭下，要看看那城究竟如何。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;耶和華上帝安排一棵蓖麻，使其發生高過約拿，影兒遮蓋他的頭，救他脫離苦楚；約拿因這棵蓖麻大大喜樂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;次日黎明，上帝卻安排一條蟲子咬這蓖麻，以致枯槁。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;日頭出來的時候，上帝安排炎熱的東風，日頭曝曬約拿的頭，使他發昏，他就為自己求死，說：「我死了比活着還好！」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;上帝對約拿說：「你因這棵蓖麻發怒合乎理嗎？」他說：「我發怒以至於死，都合乎理！」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;耶和華說：「這蓖麻不是你栽種的，也不是你培養的；一夜發生，一夜乾死，你尚且愛惜；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約拿書 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
